 relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Future heritage professionals will increasingly combine traditional historical research with GIS, remote sensing, 3D documentation, digital archives, AI-assisted research, climate-risk assessment and community participation."},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly valuable profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["History","Heritage Conservation","GIS","Digital Documentation","Project Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For built heritage, adding knowledge of architecture/conservation principles and heritage regulations is especially useful."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government, archaeological and cultural institutions"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / route","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Archaeological Survey of India","url":"https://asi.nic.in/"},{"text":"Archaeology, monuments and heritage conservation"}],[{"text":"Ministry of Culture","url":"https://www.indiaculture.gov.in/"},{"text":"Cultural policy and heritage programmes"}],[{"text":"National Museum","url":"https://www.nationalmuseumindia.gov.in/"},{"text":"Museum collections, curation and interpretation"}],[{"text":"Indian Council of Historical Research","url":"https://ichr.ac.in/"},{"text":"Historical research"}],[{"text":"Indian National Trust for Art and Cultural Heritage","url":"https://www.intach.org/"},{"text":"Heritage documentation and conservation"}],[{"text":"State archaeology departments"},{"text":"Monument and archaeological-site management"}],[{"text":"State museums"},{"text":"Collections, exhibitions and documentation"}],[{"text":"Municipal heritage cells"},{"text":"Urban heritage and heritage planning"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private/NGO opportunities"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heritage consultancies"},{"text":"Conservation architecture firms"},{"text":"Archaeological research organisations"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Cultural foundations